        "heading": "A banking-software supplier",
        "content": "Tosan's company-managed LinkedIn profile describes a business that designs, develops and supports software for banks, financial institutions and credit institutions. It identifies Tehran as its headquarters and links to tosan.com as its website. The profile also describes activity in electronic banking and electronic government, indicating a scope broader than a single core-banking product. [s1]\n\nFor readers exploring Iran's banking technology, this establishes Tosan as a relevant software supplier. It does not establish which product version a bank uses, which functions are live, or whether a deployment met its contractual objectives. Those questions require product documentation and institution-specific evidence.",
        "source_ids": ["s1"]
