        "heading": "What remains to be established",
        "content": "The profile makes promotional claims about market leadership and supplies aggregate client and staffing figures. These are company statements rather than independently verified comparisons. They are not used here to rank Tosan or construct a statistical series. [s1]\n\nThis draft remains deliberately limited. The principal website could not be inspected successfully, so product architecture, implementation history and current customer relationships are left unresolved. A fuller profile needs dated corporate records, accessible product material and bank-side confirmation of deployments.",
